scn 1
# Passing within a small click (2026-11-16; tools/legion_overtake_test.py): three speeds,
# 8 slow 2x2 bodies (1.10) in two rows, then a row of 4 mid 2x2 ones (1.9), then 4 fast 3x3 ones (2.9) at the rear,
# one right-click to a point about 300 px from the click's centre. Asset-free, open field.
name overtake-click-mid-300
ticks 4000
players 1
weapons off
map flat 128 160
type slow mover 2 2500 1 1.10
type mid mover 2 2500 1 1.9
type fast mover 3 2500 1 2.9
group S1 0 slow 5 rect 54 70 74 74 pitch=4
group S2 0 slow 3 rect 56 76 72 80 pitch=4
group M1 0 mid 4 rect 54 82 74 86 pitch=4
group F1 0 fast 4 rect 54 88 74 92 pitch=5
at 5 move S1,S2,M1,F1 64 60
